@GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5052

### The endpoint index — every route the API serves.
GET {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Liveness, plus the row counts loaded from the catalogue.
GET {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### The whole catalogue in one call — what the storefront boots from.
GET {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bootstrap
Accept: application/json

### Brand, shipping, coupons, districts, payment methods, pickup.
GET {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/meta/config
Accept: application/json

### Price a basket. Ids and quantities only — the API re-reads every rupee.
POST {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "id": "p-001", "qty": 2 }], "coupon": null, "fulfilment": "delivery" }

### The order book. Needs the passcode from Storefront:Admin:Passcode.
GET {{GopiCrackers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/orders
Accept: application/json
X-Admin-Passcode: gopi-demo-2026
